The source tree is copied from the exact commit in TOCODE_VENDOR_SOURCE.

To make application builds independent of the live models.dev catalog,
`packages/ai/src/providers/data/` is generated once with the vendored
`npm run hydrate:model-data` command and checked into the Tocode vendor
snapshot. Runtime self-update and model-catalog refresh are not used.

The root development lock adds exact `bun@1.3.13` solely as the binary
compiler. Bun 1.3.13 contains the macOS Seatbelt fix that preserves inherited
environment variables when cwd ancestors are intentionally unreadable; this
is required for the role-private `PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR` and ephemeral relay
credential. Bun is compiled into `pi` and is not installed at runtime.

Trailing whitespace in a small set of upstream documentation, examples, and
maintenance files is normalized so the enclosing Tocode repository passes its
patch-integrity check. This does not alter the Pi runtime.

`packages/coding-agent/src/core/session-manager.ts` centralizes JSONL
serialization. When the Tocode host sets
`TOGENT_REDACT_PERSISTED_IMAGES=1`, persisted image content is replaced with a
text placeholder before every initial write, append, branch rewrite, or fork
copy. Live in-memory messages retain their image data so the active turn can
still use vision.
